{"id":"en_post-office-secret-letter","title":"Post Office Secret Letter","titleEn":"Post Office Secret Letter","description":"After fifteen years working at the post office, Beatrice learns that her husband has been receiving monthly letters signed \"M.J.\" She soon discovers the truth: he writes the letters himself, posing as his former partner. As she looks into why he would do this, she comes to understand the loneliness that drove his deception. Rather than walk away, Beatrice faces the truth with him and the two set about repairing their marriage.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/post-office-secret-letter/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/post-office-secret-letter/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Affair","Family Drama","Female","Housewife","Melodrama","Misunderstanding"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsby2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_post-office-secret-letter_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsby2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_post-office-secret-letter_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsby2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_post-office-secret-letter_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsby2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_post-office-secret-letter_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsby2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_post-office